=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
issue: 216
title: `if: false` on steps that print, install or add a runner disables no suite
origin: issue #216, shared with #196 191.5: `echo "run mocha"`, `npm i -D mocha` and `bun add tap` run no runner, so none of these steps is a runner site and disabling them stays a warn
=== before: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
name: ci
on:
  pull_request:
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - run: echo "run mocha before merging" >> $GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY
      - run: npm i -D mocha
      - run: bun add tap
=== after: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
name: ci
on:
  pull_request:
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - run: echo "run mocha before merging" >> $GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY
        if: false
      - run: npm i -D mocha
        if: false
      - run: bun add tap
        if: false
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
